          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>The standard error is $\\sigma_{\\bar X} = \\dfrac{0.8}{\\sqrt{64}} = \\dfrac{0.8}{8} = 0.1$. Then<br/>$$z = \\frac{3.4 - 3.2}{0.1} = 2, \\qquad P(\\bar X \\ge 3.4) = P(Z \\ge 2) = 1 - 0.9772 = 0.0228.$$<br/>A common mistake is using $\\sigma = 0.8$ instead of the standard error, which would give $z = 0.25$.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Sai số chuẩn là $\\sigma_{\\bar X} = \\dfrac{0{,}8}{\\sqrt{64}} = \\dfrac{0{,}8}{8} = 0{,}1$. Khi đó<br/>$$z = \\frac{3{,}4 - 3{,}2}{0{,}1} = 2, \\qquad P(\\bar X \\ge 3{,}4) = P(Z \\ge 2) = 1 - 0{,}9772 = 0{,}0228.$$<br/>Lỗi thường gặp là dùng $\\sigma = 0{,}8$ thay cho sai số chuẩn, sẽ ra $z = 0{,}25$.</p></div>"
